 name properly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_13","text":"Otherwise, I'll upset you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_14","text":"That's why, Commsnder...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_15","text":"No, it's Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_16","text":"I've been practicing typing the word Commander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_17","text":"Any progress?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_18","text":"Yes!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_19","text":"Comnander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_20","text":"No, no!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_21","text":"Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_22","text":"Hahahahahaha","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_23","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_23","text":"Hahahaha","jump":"m_ex_marian_P_01_25"},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_24","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_24","text":"LOL!","jump":"m_ex_marian_P_01_27"},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_25","text":"So you think it's funny too?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_26","text":"That's great!","jump":"m_ex_marian_P_01_32"},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_27","text":"LOL?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_28","text":"What's that supposed to mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_29","text":"It also means I'm laughing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_30","text":"Ah, I see!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_31","text":"I still prefer hahaha, though.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_32","text":"Doesn't all this practicing wear you out?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_33","text":"Sure, but I find it fascinating.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_34","text":"What's more, it lets me talk with you","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_35","text":"even when I'm not there in person.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_36","text":"That makes me happy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_37","text":"What about you, Commander?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_38","text":"It makes me happy as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_39","text":"Hahaha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_40","text":"I'm glad to hear that, Cimmander.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_41","text":"Oh no...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_42","text":"Another typo.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_43","text":"Practice makes perfect.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_44","text":"Really?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_45","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_46","text":"Then I'm gonna practice more","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_47","text":"and show you what I can do!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_48","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_48","text":"You can do it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_marian_P_01_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"marian","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_marian_P_01_49","text":"Yes, I will!","jump":null}],"chat":true}